FlashInfer
----------

    Upstream:   https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer, v0.6.15
    Copyright:  Copyright (c) 2023-2025 by FlashInfer team
    Licence:    Apache License 2.0
    Derived:    kernels/attn/fa2/*.cuh

The FA2 paged prefill and decode, their merge and the FA2 MLA kernel, with the
headers they need. Changed from upstream:

  * moved from `kernels/flashinfer/` into `kernels/attn/fa2/`, the namespace
    `flashinfer` renamed `pie::attn::fa2` and the `FLASHINFER_` macros
    `PIE_FA2_`;
  * cut to what Pie launches: kernels nothing names (the single-request and
    cascade kernels, the KV append and rotary kernels) are deleted;
  * host-side code removed or guarded so NVRTC can compile the device text;
  * a sliding-window variant added to the paged decode;
  * comments cut (commit 1f667f90, 2026-09-09).

A diff against upstream v0.6.15 is the exact record of every change.


